@host = https://localhost:5001

### 创建工单 (CreateTicket)
POST {{host}}/api/Tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "打印机无法连接",
  "description": "办公区3号打印机无法连接网络",
  "ticketType": "IT_SUPPORT",
  "priority": "P2",
  "creatorId": 1001
}

### 获取单个工单 (GetTicket)
GET {{host}}/api/Tickets/1
Accept: application/json